{"about_the_game":"Begin a brand-new cosy life in the world of Palworld!<br>Together with the mysterious creatures known as Pals that you meet on the Palpagos Islands, build the farm of your dreams in Palfarm!<br><br>Move to an island where Pals live and have them help with farm work, cook alongside them, shop at stores they run, or gather materials to expand your farm.<br>Show your gratitude to the Pals who help you each day by giving them gifts.<br><br>On this island with its changing seasons, a relaxing farm life with Pals awaits!<br>Of course, eating your own Pals is absolutely out of the question!<br>In Palfarm, Pals and people live together peacefully in harmony!!<br><br><strong><u>Farming</u></strong><br>Even barren land can be transformed into a bountiful farm if you work hard together with your Pals.<br>Each Pal makes use of its special abilities to support to help support your farm!<br>Pals skilled at sowing will plant seeds, those good at watering will water the crops each day, and Pals skilled with their hands will help harvest  crops or assist with crafting.<br>\u2026Is one of your Pals slacking off? Time to teach them the joy of working.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/9cc731218150887c5018f52a29363178.poster.avif?t=1758603379\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/9cc731218150887c5018f52a29363178.webm?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/9cc731218150887c5018f52a29363178.mp4?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Island Life</u></strong><br>The island is home to many unique Pals and residents.<br>Through daily conversations, working together, or giving gifts from time to time, you can gradually deepen your relationships with both the Pals and the people of the island.<br>Perhaps the Pals themselves might even play matchmaker with someone you're interested in.<br>It's even possible for your bond with a Pal or resident to grow into a special relationship\u2026<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/d55437ea1c5fcde7d00c413b9f72b487.poster.avif?t=1758603379\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/d55437ea1c5fcde7d00c413b9f72b487.webm?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/d55437ea1c5fcde7d00c413b9f72b487.mp4?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Combat</u></strong><br>On the island, nasty Pals that raid farms and ferocious Pals lurking underground await.<br>Defeat them to obtain resources to further develop your farm.<br>After all, combat is a form of harvesting in its own way...<br>Sometimes what you reap might be red\u2026<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/07dfb0931d6b339ce502ecf2799798b8.poster.avif?t=1758603379\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/07dfb0931d6b339ce502ecf2799798b8.webm?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/07dfb0931d6b339ce502ecf2799798b8.mp4?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Marketplace</u></strong><br>On the island there is a marketplace run by residents and Pals where you can buy and sell crops and crafted goods.<br>Rare items can sometimes be found there.<br>Rumour has it there's also a forbidden black market hidden away on the island's far side.<br>Guns, suspicious fertiliser...all sorts of things to trade...the consequences of buying these items are entirely your own responsibility.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/ce83fdbb178c8a9da5fa46978e1f1fa5.poster.avif?t=1758603379\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/ce83fdbb178c8a9da5fa46978e1f1fa5.webm?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/ce83fdbb178c8a9da5fa46978e1f1fa5.mp4?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><u>Multiplayer</u></strong><br>This game supports multiplayer!<br>Invite your friends and enjoy a cosy life together!<br>Who you choose to build your farm with, and what kind of farm you create, is entirely up to you.<br>Your very own story begins in Palfarm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/dfcaa31a1e6907b78d7643b2dfdf99f5.poster.avif?t=1758603379\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/dfcaa31a1e6907b78d7643b2dfdf99f5.webm?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031890/extras/dfcaa31a1e6907b78d7643b2dfdf99f5.mp4?t=1758603379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031890?t=1758603379","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031890?t=1758603379","capsule_imag